<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 92 0 R
/E (Performance Marketing is a data-driven and result-oriented approach that focuses on achieving measurable outcomes such as clicks, leads, and sales. It allows businesses to target the right audience, control their budget, and track campaign performance in real time. By using platforms like Google Ads and Meta Business Suite, marketers can optimize their campaigns continuously for better results. Key elements such as proper targeting, effective bidding strategies, conversion tracking, and regular optimization play a crucial role in success. Overall, performance marketing helps businesses achieve higher return on investment \(ROI\) and supports long-term growth through informed decision-making.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
